  "summary": "Milwaukee police officer Josue Ayala was criminally charged with attempted misconduct in public office after using Flock Safety license plate reader technology to track a person he was dating (124 searches) and that person's ex (55 searches) over two months in 2025. The ex discovered the surveillance via the Have I Been Flocked website.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Mr. Ayala ran searches on his partner's license plate 124 times from March to May 2025, according to the complaint.",
      "paragraph_idx": 7
    },
    {
      "quote": "Mr. Ayala's partner's ex learned about the location tracking from the website Have I Been Flocked, which shows people when their license plates have been searched in the company's systems.",
